],"Add to cart button":["加入购物车按钮"],"Visit our store":["欢迎光临我们的门店"],"Main Street 12, Springfield":["Main Street 12, Springfield"],"Mon–Fri 9:00–18:00, Sat 9:00–13:00":["周一至周五 9:00–18:00，周六 9:00–13:00"],"Get directions":["获取路线"],"Place":["地点"],"Map":["地图"],"Google Maps":["Google Maps"],"OpenStreetMap":["OpenStreetMap"],"Address":["地址"],"E.g. \"Main Street 12, Springfield\". Or leave it empty and enter the coordinates.":["例如“Main Street 12, Springfield”。也可以留空并输入坐标。"],"Latitude":["纬度"],"OpenStreetMap needs the coordinates, e.g. 50.0815. Find them by a right-click on the place in openstreetmap.org (\"Show address\").":["OpenStreetMap 需要坐标，例如 50.0815。在 openstreetmap.org 上右键单击该地点（“显示地址”）即可找到。"],"Optional, more precise than the address.":["可选，比地址更精确。"],"Longitude":["经度"],"Map type":["地图类型"],"Satellite":["卫星"],"Google Maps API key (optional)":["Google Maps API 密钥（可选）"],"The map works without a key. With a key of the Maps Embed API (free in the Google Cloud console) it uses the official embed.":["地图无需密钥即可使用。使用 Maps Embed API 的密钥（在 Google Cloud 控制台中免费获取）时，将使用官方嵌入方式。"],"Height":["高度"],"In pixels":["以像素为单位"],"Part of the screen height":["屏幕高度的比例"],"Height (% of the screen)":["高度（屏幕的 %）"],"Height (px)":["高度（px）"],"Black and white map":["黑白地图"],"Visitors can move and zoom the map":["访客可以移动和缩放地图"],"Off: the map is only a picture in the background.":["关闭：地图仅作为背景图片。"],"Content on the map":["地图上的内容"],"In a card":["在卡片中"],"Horizontal position":["水平位置"],"Vertical position":["垂直位置"],"Top":["顶部"],"Middle":["中间"],"Bottom":["底部"],"Width (px)":["宽度（px）"],"Under the map on phones":["手机上显示在地图下方"],"Privacy":["隐私"],"Load the map only after a click":["仅在点击后加载地图"],"The map service (and its cookies) loads only when the visitor clicks the button; the choice is remembered in the browser.":["地图服务（及其 Cookie）仅在访客点击按钮后加载；该选择会记录在浏览器中。"],"Show the map":["显示地图"],"Text above the button":["按钮上方的文本"],"The map is loaded from OpenStreetMap.":["地图从 OpenStreetMap 加载。"],"The map is loaded from Google Maps, which may store cookies.":["地图从 Google Maps 加载，可能会存储 Cookie。"],"Color over the map":["地图上的颜色"],"Enter the latitude and longitude of the place in the block settings.":["请在区块设置中输入该地点的纬度和经度。"],"Enter the address (or the coordinates) of the place in the block settings.":["请在区块设置中输入该地点的地址（或坐标）。"],"Add message":["添加消息"],"Behaviour":["行为"],"Show the messages":["显示消息"],"One at a time, taking turns":["一次一条，轮流显示"],"Scrolling ticker (marquee)":["滚动字幕（跑马灯）"],"All side by side":["全部并排"],"Nothing moves for visitors who turned on \"reduce motion\", and the bar stops while the pointer or the keyboard is in it.":["对于开启“减少动态效果”的访客，内容不会移动；当鼠标指针或键盘焦点在栏中时，栏会停止。"],"Seconds per message":["每条消息的秒数"],"Show arrows":["显示箭头"],"Speed (pixels per second)":["速度（每秒像素）"],"Visitors can close the bar":["访客可以关闭此栏"],"Keep it closed for (days)":["保持关闭（天）"],"0 = until the browser tab is closed. Changing the messages shows the bar again.":["0 = 直到关闭浏览器标签页。更改消息后会再次显示此栏。"],"Counts down to":["倒计时至"],"End":["结束"],"A date and time":["日期和时间"],"A time every day":["每天的某个时间"],"Ends at":["结束于"],"In the time zone of the site (Settings > General). Every visitor sees the same end.":["使用网站的时区（设置 > 常规）。每位访客看到的结束时间相同。"],"Every day at":["每天于"],"For example the cut-off time for same-day shipping. In the time zone of the site.":["例如当日发货的截止时间。使用网站的时区。"],"On these days":["在这些日子"],"After the time and on other days":["该时间之后及其他日子"],"Count down to the next chosen day":["倒计时到下一个所选日子"],"Hide until the next chosen day":["隐藏到下一个所选日子"],"When it ends":["结束时"],"Hide the block":["隐藏区块"],"Show a text":["显示文本"],"Text when it ends":["结束时的文本"],"This offer has ended.":["此优惠已结束。"],"Text above (optional)":["上方文本（可选）"],"Sale ends in":["促销结束倒计时"],"Numbers in boxes":["方框中的数字"],"Plain numbers":["纯数字"],"Show days":["显示天数"],"Off: the hours go above 24.":["关闭：小时数会超过 24。"],"Show seconds":["显示秒数"],"Show labels":["显示标签"],"Numbers":["数字"],"Boxes":["方框"],"Labels":["标签"],"Week":["周"],"For example 9:00-17:00, or 9:00-12:00, 13:00-18:00 with a lunch break. Leave empty for closed. A time after midnight (18:00-2:00) belongs to the day it starts.":["例如 9:00-17:00，或含午休的 9:00-12:00, 13:00-18:00。留空表示休息。跨午夜的时间（18:00-2:00）属于开始的那一天。"],"Closed":["休息"],"Special days":["特殊日子"],"Holidays and other days":["节假日和其他日子"],"One per line: 2026-12-24 = 9:00-12:00 | Christmas Eve, or 12-25 = (closed every year). The note after | is optional.":["每行一个：2026-12-24 = 9:00-12:00 | 平安夜，或 12-25 =（每年休息）。| 后面的备注为可选。"],"List the special days of the next 30 days":["列出未来 30 天内的特殊日子"],"Opening hours":["营业时间"],"Show \"Open now / Closed\"":["显示“营业中 / 已打烊”"],"Worked out in the visitor's browser in the time zone of the site, so it is right on cached pages too.":["在访客浏览器中按网站时区计算，因此在缓存页面上也是正确的。"],"Show the week":["显示一周"],"Highlight today":["突出显示今天"],"Join days with the same hours":["合并营业时间相同的日子"],"Monday – Friday instead of five rows.":["显示“周一 – 周五”，而不是五行。"],"Text for closed days":["休息日的文本"],"Box with a border":["带边框的框"],"Open":["营业中"],"Today":["今天"],"Stock":["库存"],"Stock of":["库存对象"],"Only the real stock is shown: the product (or variation) needs \"Manage stock?\" turned on in WooCommerce.":["仅显示真实库存：产品（或变体）需要在 WooCommerce 中开启“管理库存？”。"],"Show \"Only … left\" at this stock or less":["库存不高于此数时显示“仅剩 …”"],"The bar is full at":["库存达到此数时条形为满"],"Stock at or above this number fills the bar.":["库存达到或高于此数时条形填满。"],"Show \"In stock\" above that number":["高于该数时显示“有货”"],"Show \"Out of stock\" and backorders":["显示“缺货”和预订"],"Leave empty for the default text. {stock} is the number in stock.":["留空则使用默认文本。{stock} 为库存数量。"],"Low stock":["库存不足"],"Only {stock} left in stock":["仅剩 {stock} 件"],"In stock":["有货"],"Out of stock":["缺货"],"On backorder":["可预订"],"Available on backorder":["可预订"],"Show the bar":["显示条形"],"Show the colored dot":["显示彩色圆点"],"Bar":["条形"],"Bar background":["条形背景"],"Lowest price":["最低价格"],"Price of":["价格："],"The lowest price comes from the price history that Envo Blocks keeps for every product. Defaults: Envo Blocks > Lowest Price.":["最低价格来自 Envo Blocks 为每个产品保存的价格历史。默认值：Envo Blocks > 最低价格。"],"Number of days (0 = the setting)":["天数（0 = 使用设置）"],"The EU rule is 30 days.":["欧盟规定为 30 天。"],"Show it":["显示"],"As in the setting":["与设置相同"],"Only for products on sale":["仅限促销产品"],"For every product":["所有产品"],"{days} is the number of days, {price} the lowest price. Leave empty for the text of the setting.":["{days} 为天数，{price} 为最低价格。留空则使用设置中的文本。"],"Lowest price in the last {days} days: {price}":["最近 {days} 天最低价格：{price}"],"With a background":["带背景"],"Attribute (color, size …)":["属性（颜色、尺码 …）"],"Category":["分类"],"Stock status":["库存状态"],"On sale":["促销"],"Brand":["品牌"],"Check boxes":["复选框"],"Links":["链接"],"Buttons":["按钮"],"Dropdown":["下拉列表"],"Swatches (colors, images)":["色板（颜色、图片）"],"Filter":["筛选"],"Filters the products of the shop, the categories and the product search (classic shop or the Product Collection block). On other pages the options link to the shop.":["筛选商店、分类和产品搜索中的产品（经典商店或 Product Collection 区块）。在其他页面上，选项会链接到商店。"],"Filter by":["筛选依据"],"Attribute":["属性"],"The first attribute":["第一个属性"],"More values":["多个值"],"Products with any of them":["包含任一项的产品"],"Products with all of them":["包含全部的产品"],"Levels of subcategories":["子分类层级"],"On a category page the filter lists its subcategories.":["在分类页面上，筛选器会列出其子分类。"],"Step of the slider":["滑块步长"],"Leave empty for the name of the filter.":["留空则使用筛选器名称。"],"Hide the title":["隐藏标题"],"Collapsible":["可折叠"],"Yes, open":["是，展开"],"Yes, closed":["是，收起"],"Show the number of products":["显示产品数量"],"Options before \"Show more\" (0 = all)":["“显示更多”之前的选项数（0 = 全部）"],"Hide options without products":["隐藏没有产品的选项"],"Otherwise they are greyed out. Options that no product of the page has are never shown.":["否则以灰色显示。页面中没有任何产品具备的选项永远不会显示。"],"Envo Blocks PRO filters without reloading the page and adds brands, \"On sale\", swatches, buttons, dropdowns and a filter drawer for phones.":["Envo Blocks PRO 无需重新加载页面即可筛选，并添加品牌、“促销中”、色板、按钮、下拉列表以及手机端筛选抽屉。"],"Active filters":["已选筛选"],"Shown only while a filter is on. The preview shows a sample.":["仅在启用筛选时显示。预览中显示示例。"],"Show \"Clear all\"":["显示“全部清除”"],"Track your order":["追踪您的订单"],"Enter your order number and the email address you used at checkout. The order number is in the confirmation email.":["请输入您的订单号和结账时使用的电子邮件地址。订单号在确认邮件中。"],"The form is the WooCommerce order tracking: after a search the order and its updates appear in the same place.":["该表单是 WooCommerce 的订单追踪：搜索后，订单及其更新会显示在同一位置。"],"Free shipping":["免运费"],"Amount for free shipping":["免运费金额"],"From WooCommerce \"Free shipping\" methods":["来自 WooCommerce 的“免运费”方式"],"Set here":["在此设置"],"Automatic uses the lowest minimum order amount of the Free shipping methods in your shipping zones.":["自动使用您配送区域中“免运费”方式的最低订单金额。"],"Amount (in the shop currency)":["金额（商店货币）"],"Hide when free shipping is reached":["达到免运费后隐藏"],"Use {remaining} for the missing amount and {threshold} for the free shipping amount. Leave empty for the default text.":["使用 {remaining} 表示差额，使用 {threshold} 表示免运费金额。留空则使用默认文本。"],"While the amount is not reached":["未达到金额时"],"Add {remaining} more to get free shipping!":["再买 {remaining} 即可享受免运费！"],"When it is reached":["达到金额时"],"You have free shipping!":["您已享受免运费！"],"When the cart is empty":["购物车为空时"],"Free shipping on orders over {threshold}.":["订单满 {threshold} 免运费。"],"Text alignment":["文本对齐"],"Show progress bar":["显示进度条"],"Bar when reached":["达到时的条形"],"Round heart":["圆形爱心"],"Bookmark":["书签"],"The wishlist page could not be created.":["无法创建心愿单页面。"],"Wishlist page:":["心愿单页面："],"Edit":["编辑"],"No wishlist page is set yet: this page becomes the wishlist page when it is published.":["尚未设置心愿单页面：此页面发布后将成为心愿单页面。"],"You have no wishlist page yet. The \"View\" link after saving a product leads there.":["您还没有心愿单页面。保存产品后的“查看”链接会指向那里。"],"Create the wishlist page":["创建心愿单页面"],"Set it in WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced":["在 WooCommerce > 设置 > 高级 中设置"],"Wishlist button":["心愿单按钮"],"On the product page and in a product template (Product Collection) the button uses that product. Choose a product only to place the button somewhere else.":["在产品页面和产品模板（Product Collection）中，按钮使用该产品。仅在要将按钮放在其他位置时才选择产品。"],"Button with an icon and text":["带图标和文字的按钮"],"Round icon":["圆形图标"],"Icon and text (link style)":["图标和文字（链接样式）"],"Add to wishlist":["加入心愿单"],"Text when saved":["保存后的文本"],"In your wishlist":["已在心愿单中"],"Icon and text":["图标和文本"],"Icon when saved":["保存后的图标"],"Wishlist":["心愿单"],"The preview shows a few products of the shop; visitors see their own saved products.":["预览显示商店的几件产品；访客看到的是自己保存的产品。"],"Grid of cards":["卡片网格"],"List (rows)":["列表（行）"],"Up to 3 on tablets, 2 on phones.":["平板最多 3 个，手机最多 2 个。"],"Products with options get a link to the product page.":["带选项的产品会显示指向产品页面的链接。"],"Remove from the wishlist after adding to the cart":["加入购物车后从心愿单中移除"],"A share link, \"Add all to cart\", hearts on product images and a header icon with a drawer are in Envo Blocks PRO.":["分享链接、“全部加入购物车”、产品图片上的爱心以及带抽屉的页眉图标位于 Envo Blocks PRO 中。"],"Empty wishlist":["空心愿单"],"Your wishlist is empty":["您的心愿单是空的"],"Tap the heart on any product to save it for later.":["点击任意产品上的爱心即可保存以备后用。"],"The button leads to the shop.":["按钮指向商店。"],"Continue shopping":["继续购物"],"As in Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code":["与 Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code 中相同"],"Payment":["支付"],"QR code format":["二维码格式"],"Automatic: QR Platba for CZK, EPC QR for EUR":["自动：CZK 使用 QR Platba，EUR 使用 EPC QR"],"Only QR Platba (CZK)":["仅 QR Platba（CZK）"],"Only EPC QR (EUR)":["仅 EPC QR（EUR）"],"Orders in other currencies get no code.":["其他货币的订单不生成二维码。"],"Account":["账户"],"The accounts with an IBAN from WooCommerce > Settings > Payments > Direct bank transfer.":["来自 WooCommerce > 设置 > 支付 > 直接银行转账 中带 IBAN 的账户。"],"Payment message":["付款附言"],"Placeholders: {order_number}, {order_id}, {site_title}. Empty = as in Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code.":["占位符：{order_number}、{order_id}、{site_title}。留空 = 与 Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code 中相同。"],"Put the block in the Order Confirmation template. It shows only for orders paid by direct bank transfer that wait for the payment.":["将此区块放入订单确认模板中。仅对通过直接银行转账支付且等待付款的订单显示。"],"Pay by QR code":["扫码支付"],"Scan the code with the app of your bank: the account, amount and reference are filled in.":["用您银行的应用扫描此码：账户、金额和参考号会自动填写。"],"Payment details":["付款详情"],"Account, amount, variable symbol and message for entering the payment by hand.":["用于手动填写付款的账户、金额、可变符号和附言。"],"Code beside the details":["二维码在详情旁边"],"Code above the details":["二维码在详情上方"],"QR code size (px)":["二维码大小（px）"],"Empty = the document name and number, e.g. \"Invoice 202600012 (PDF)\".":["留空 = 文档名称和编号，例如“发票 202600012（PDF）”。"],"Credit notes too":["也包括贷项通知单"],"Put the block in the Order Confirmation template. It shows when the invoice of the order is issued (Envo Blocks > Invoices).":["将此区块放入订单确认模板中。当订单的发票开具后显示（Envo Blocks > 发票）。"],"Additional information":["附加信息"],"Reviews ({count})":["评价（{count}）"],"Own content (blocks)":["自定义内容（区块）"],"The product's own tabs":["产品自身的选项卡"],"Tabs of other plugins":["其他插件的选项卡"],"Content of the tab: text, images, a table, any blocks…":["选项卡的内容：文本、图片、表格、任意区块…"],"Tab":["选项卡"],"New tab":["新选项卡"],"Tabs":["选项卡"],"Every tab is a Product Tab block: click a tab to edit it, move it with the arrows of its toolbar or in the List View, add one with the + button. Tabs without content for a product (no description, no attributes, reviews off) are left out.":["每个选项卡都是一个 Product Tab 区块：点击选项卡进行编辑，使用其工具栏中的箭头或在列表视图中移动它，用 + 按钮添加新选项卡。对某个产品没有内容的选项卡（没有描述、没有属性、评价已关闭）会被省略。"],"Tabs of":["选项卡对象"],"Headings inside the panels":["面板内的标题"],"The \"Description\" and \"Additional information\" headings WooCommerce prints above the text.":["WooCommerce 在文本上方显示的“描述”和“附加信息”标题。"],"Show as":["显示为"],"Accordion":["手风琴"],"Tabs position":["选项卡位置"],"Boxed":["带框"],"Pills":["胶囊"],"Text only":["仅文本"],"Tabs alignment":["选项卡对齐"],"Full width":["全宽"],"Width of the tabs column (px)":["选项卡列的宽度（px）"],"Accordion on phones":["手机上使用手风琴"],"Below 782 px the tabs turn into an accordion.":["低于 782 px 时选项卡变为手风琴。"],"First item open":["默认展开第一项"],"More items open at once":["可同时展开多项"],"The editor shows the items as tabs; the page shows the accordion.":["编辑器以选项卡显示各项；页面上显示为手风琴。"],"Space around the content (px)":["内容周围的间距（px）"],"Tab text":["选项卡文本"],"Active tab text":["活动选项卡的文本"],"Accent (line, active pill)":["强调色（线条、活动胶囊）"],"Tab background":["选项卡背景"],"Active tab background":["活动选项卡的背景"],"Lines and borders":["线条和边框"],"Content background":["内容背景"],"Content text":["内容文本"],"Adds its tabs only when the product has them.":["仅在产品有这些选项卡时才添加。"],"Add tab":["添加选项卡"],"Dimensions":["尺寸"],"Color":["颜色"],"Black, White":["黑色、白色"],"The reviews of the product and the form for a new review.":["产品的评价以及发表新评价的表单。"],"The tabs of the product (Products > Edit > Product data > Tabs), each as its own tab, here in the order. Nothing when the product has none.":["产品的选项卡（产品 > 编辑 > 产品数据 > 选项卡），每个作为单独的选项卡，按此处顺序显示。产品没有时不显示。"],"Tabs that other plugins add to WooCommerce products (e.g. vendor info, FAQ, size charts), each as its own tab. Nothing when there are none.":["其他插件添加到 WooCommerce 产品的选项卡（例如卖家信息、常见问题、尺码表），每个作为单独的选项卡。没有时不显示。"],"The description of the product (its main text) is shown here.":["此处显示产品的描述（其主要文本）。"],"filled on the product page":["在产品页面上填充"],"{count} is the number of reviews.":["{count} 为评价数量。"],"e.g. Shipping & returns":["例如 配送与退货"],"Only for products in these categories":["仅限这些分类中的产品"],"Empty = every product.":["留空 = 所有产品。"],"How long does delivery take?":["配送需要多长时间？"],"Orders placed by 2 pm on a working day leave the same day. Delivery usually takes 1–3 working days.":["工作日 14:00 前下单当天发货。配送通常需要 1–3 个工作日。"],"Can I return a product?":["可以退货吗？"],"Yes, within 30 days of delivery. Unused products in their original packaging get a full refund.":["可以，收货后 30 天内均可退货。未使用且包装完好的商品全额退款。"],"Which payment methods do you accept?":["支持哪些付款方式？"],"Cards, Apple Pay and Google Pay, bank transfer and cash on delivery.":["银行卡、Apple Pay 和 Google Pay、银行转账以及货到付款。"],"The answer: text, a list, an image, a button…":["回答：文字、列表、图片、按钮…"],"Questions":["问题"],"Every question is a FAQ Item block: type the question, the answer below it is made of blocks. Add a question with the + button, move it with the arrows of its toolbar. The editor shows all answers; the page shows them when a question is clicked.":["每个问题都是一个“FAQ 条目”区块：输入问题，下方的回答由区块组成。用 + 按钮添加问题，用其工具栏中的箭头移动。编辑器显示所有回答；页面在点击问题时显示。"],"First question open":["第一个问题展开"],"More questions open at once":["可同时展开多个问题"],"Off: opening a question closes the open one.":["关闭：展开一个问题会收起已展开的问题。"],"Question as":["问题标题级别"],"Heading 2":["标题 2"],"Heading 3":["标题 3"],"Heading 4":["标题 4"],"For the outline of the page; the look stays the same.":["用于页面大纲；外观保持不变。"],"FAQ data for search engines":["搜索引擎 FAQ 数据"],"Adds schema.org FAQPage data (JSON-LD) with the questions and answers to the page. Turn it off when an SEO plugin already adds FAQ data for this page.":["向页面添加含问题和回答的 schema.org FAQPage 数据（JSON-LD）。如果 SEO 插件已为此页面添加 FAQ 数据，请关闭。"],"Cards":["卡片"],"One box":["单个方框"],"Lines":["线条"],"Plus / minus":["加号 / 减号"],"Arrow":["箭头"],"Space between questions (px)":["问题间距（px）"],"Inner space (px)":["内边距（px）"],"Question text":["问题文字"],"Background of the open question":["展开问题的背景"],"Answer text":["回答文字"],"FAQ Item":["FAQ 条目"],"Question":["问题"],"Open when the page loads":["页面加载时展开"],"Question…":["问题…"],"Customers ask on the product page; you answer in Envo Blocks › Settings › Product Questions. Only answered questions are shown.":["顾客在商品页面提问；您在“Envo Blocks › 设置 › 商品问答”中回答。只显示已回答的问题。"],"Questions of":["问题来源"],"Questions & answers":["问答"],"Questions before \"Show more\"":["“显示更多”前的问题数"],"Search field":["搜索框"],"From 4 answered questions.":["已回答问题达到 4 个时显示。"],"\"Ask a question\" form":["“提问”表单"],"Accent (Q / A, buttons)":["强调色（Q / A、按钮）"],"Loading…":["正在加载…"],"Other form (shortcode)":["其他表单（短代码）"],"No supported form plugin is active. Install Contact Form 7, WPForms, Fluent Forms, Ninja Forms, Formidable Forms, Forminator or Gravity Forms, or paste the shortcode of another form.":["没有启用受支持的表单插件。请安装 Contact Form 7、WPForms、Fluent Forms、Ninja Forms、Formidable Forms、Forminator 或 Gravity Forms，或者粘贴其他表单的短代码。"],"The form plugin keeps the fields, e-mails and entries; this block gives the form your look.":["字段、邮件和提交记录仍由表单插件管理；此区块为表单套用您的外观。"],"Form plugin":["表单插件"],"Form shortcode":["表单短代码"],"One shortcode only, for example [my_form id=\"3\"]. The fields get the look of the block; how well depends on the form plugin.":["仅限一个短代码，例如 [my_form id=\"3\"]。字段会套用区块的外观，效果取决于表单插件。"],"Form":["表单"],"This plugin has no published form yet. Make one in its menu and come back.":["此插件还没有已发布的表单。请在插件菜单中创建表单后再回来。"],"This form plugin is not active.":["此表单插件未启用。"],"Fields":["字段"],"Field style":["字段样式"],"Filled":["填充"],"Line under the field":["字段下方的线条"],"One column":["一栏"],"Two columns (short fields side by side)":["两列（短字段并排）"],"Label size (px, 0 = as the text)":["标签大小（px，0 = 与正文相同）"],"Corner radius":["圆角"],"Space inside the fields":["字段内边距"],"Border width":["边框粗细"],"Space between the fields":["字段间距"],"Width":["宽度"],"By the text":["按文字宽度"],"Corner radius (-1 = as the theme buttons)":["圆角（-1 = 与主题按钮相同）"],"Labels and fields":["标签和字段"],"Field text":["字段文字"],"Field background":["字段背景"],"Field border":["字段边框"],"Active field, checkboxes":["当前字段、复选框"],"Button colors":["按钮颜色"],"Background on hover":["悬停时的背景"],"Text on hover":["悬停时的文字"],"Sent":["已发送"],"Errors":["错误"],"Languages":["语言"],"Shows the languages of WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress, in their order. Each link opens the same page in the other language.":["按顺序显示 WPML、Polylang 或 TranslatePress 的语言。每个链接都会以另一种语言打开同一页面。"],"Row of links":["一行链接"],"Flag and name":["国旗和名称"],"Flag":["国旗"],"Flag and code":["国旗和代码"],"Code (EN, DE)":["代码（EN、DE）"],"Flag shape":["国旗形状"],"Rectangle":["矩形"],"Circle":["圆形"],"Hide the current language":["隐藏当前语言"],"Hide languages without a translation of the page":["隐藏没有该页面翻译的语言"],"WPML and Polylang: otherwise such a language links to its home page.":["WPML 和 Polylang：否则该语言会链接到它的首页。"],"Menu opens to the":["菜单展开方向"],"Right (aligned left)":["向右（左对齐）"],"Left (aligned right)":["向左（右对齐）"],"Current language and hover":["当前语言和悬停"],"Menu background":["菜单背景"],"Menu text":["菜单文字"],"Switch":["开关"],"Visitors choose whether the prices are shown with or without tax; every price of the store follows. Shows only when WooCommerce calculates taxes. More in Envo Blocks › Settings › Tax Switcher.":["访客可选择以含税或不含税显示价格；商店中的每个价格都会随之变化。仅在 WooCommerce 计算税费时显示。详见“Envo Blocks › 设置 › 含税切换”。"],"Two buttons":["两个按钮"],"Order of the options":["选项顺序"],"With tax first":["含税在前"],"Without tax first":["不含税在前"],"Text for prices with tax":["含税价格的文字"],"Empty = \"Incl. VAT\" (or \"Incl. Tax\", by the country of the store).":["留空 =“含增值税”（或根据商店所在国家显示“含税”）。"],"Text for prices without tax":["不含税价格的文字"],"Empty = \"Excl. VAT\" (or \"Excl. Tax\").":["留空 =“不含增值税”（或“不含税”）。"],"Show a label":["显示标签"],"Label":["标签"],"Active background":["当前选项背景"],"Active text":["当前选项文字"],"Summer collection":["夏季系列"],"Light fabrics and bright colors for warm days.":["轻薄面料与明快色彩，适合温暖的日子。"],"Shop now":["立即选购"],"Choose an image or a video":["选择图片或视频"],"Replace the background":["替换背景"],"Remove the background":["移除背景"],"Focal point":["焦点"],"Alternative text":["替代文本"],"Describe the image if it says something the text does not; leave it empty for a decorative background.":["如果图片表达了文字中没有的内容，请描述它；装饰性背景请留空。"],"Overlay opacity (%)":["遮罩不透明度（%）"],"A darker overlay keeps light text readable on any photo. Its color is under Styles.":["较深的遮罩可让浅色文字在任何照片上都清晰易读。其颜色在“样式”中设置。"],"Parallax":["视差"],"Effect while scrolling":["滚动时的效果"],"Parallax (the background moves slower)":["视差（背景移动得更慢）"],"Zoom (the background grows)":["缩放（背景逐渐放大）"],"None (a still background)":["无（静止的背景）"],"Strength":["强度"],"Reverse (from bigger to normal)":["反向（从放大到正常）"],"Reverse (the background moves faster than the page)":["反向（背景比页面移动得更快）"],"Also on phones":["手机上也显示"],"Off: a still background on screens up to 781 px.":["关闭：在 781 px 及以下的屏幕上背景保持静止。"],"The effect runs on the site; the editor shows a still background. Visitors who turned on \"reduce motion\" in their system see a still background too.":["效果在网站上运行；编辑器中显示静止的背景。在系统中开启“减弱动态效果”的访客也会看到静止的背景。"],"Size and content":["尺寸和内容"],"Minimum height":["最小高度"],"Minimum height (% of the screen)":["最小高度（屏幕的 %）"],"Minimum height (px)":["最小高度（px）"],"Content width (px)":["内容宽度（px）"],"0 = the content width of the theme.":["0 = 主题的内容宽度。"],"Content position":["内容位置"],"Overlay":["遮罩"],"Background without an image":["无图片时的背景"],"On this page":["本页内容"],"Overview":["概览"],"Details":["详情"],"Sticking":["固定"],"The blocks stay in view inside the column or group this block is in, until its end. Put it in the shorter column of a Columns block. The editor shows it without sticking.":["这些区块会在本区块所在的栏或组中保持可见，直到其末尾。请把它放在分栏区块中较短的一栏里。编辑器中显示为不固定。"],"Space at the top":["顶部间距"],"Below a sticky header (automatic)":["在固定页眉下方（自动）"],"From the top of the screen":["从屏幕顶部开始"],"Extra space (px)":["额外间距（px）"],"Space from the top (px)":["距顶部的距离（px）"],"Space at the bottom (px)":["底部间距（px）"],"For content taller than the screen: it floats – while scrolling down it stops this far above the bottom, while scrolling up at the top.":["内容高于屏幕时：它会浮动——向下滚动时停在距底部这么远的位置，向上滚动时停在顶部。"],"Sticky on":["固定于"],"Computers and tablets":["电脑和平板"],"Computers only":["仅电脑"],"Every screen, phones too":["所有屏幕，包括手机"],"Documentation":["文档"]}}}